# Metadata for the RStudio New Project wizard.
# Binding must name an EXPORTED function in actepir.
# Reference: https://rstudio.github.io/rstudio-extensions/rstudio_project_templates.html
#
# The .dcf format has no conditional or dependent widget support. The only
# widget fields are Parameter, Widget, Label, Default, Position and - for
# SelectInput - Fields, so options cannot be greyed out in response to each
# other. The dependency below is enforced inside use_epi_analysis() instead,
# which drops the selection and SQL chunks when the connection chunk is off.

Binding: use_epi_analysis
Title: ACT Epidemiology Analysis (Quarto)
Subtitle: Branded Quarto analysis using the acthd format extension
Caption: Create a new Quarto analysis
OpenFiles: *.qmd

Parameter: conn
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Include odbc connection chunk
Default: On
Position: left

Parameter: sel
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Include dbplyr selection chunk (needs connection)
Default: On
Position: right

Parameter: sql
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Include native SQL chunk (needs connection)
Default: Off
Position: left

Parameter: bib
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Include bibliography stub
Default: On
Position: right

Parameter: dirs
Widget: CheckboxInput
Label: Create standard sub-folders
Default: On
Position: left
